    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hunt monsters, collect crystals, stay alive in a mystical realm.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your magic staff to shoot through endless horde of enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>You are trapped in an illusory realm.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After the events of the previous game you have found yourself trapped in an illusion realm, where you fight for survival.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your goal is to survive for as long as possible.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The enemies will spawn endlessly, you must fight them off in order to survive. They will flock around you if they see you, so you should be on your toes.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect crystals and defeat enemies.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are mystical magical crystals constantly spawning in the realm. Collect them as much as you can while evading the enemies and fighting them for your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck wanderer!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Have fun.</strong></h2>",
